   Strand, Douglas W., UT Southwestern Med Ctr, Dept Urol, Dallas, TX USA.
   Lee, MinJae, Univ Texas Hlth Sci Ctr Houston, Biostat Epidemiol Res Design Core, Dept Internal Med, Houston, TX 77030 USA.},
